WEBVTT

open
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.626
Hi Ann. This is your own copy of the Meissner.Services website, and this is how you tell us what to change.

signin
00:00:07.428 --> 00:00:18.791
The first time, it asks who you are. Choose Sign in with Email, type your email address, and press Send magic link. We email you a link. Click it, and you're in.

live
00:00:19.591 --> 00:00:26.217
This is Version 1: the site as it is today. In Live, it works like the real thing, so scroll around and try it.

review
00:00:27.069 --> 00:00:33.510
When you have something to say, switch to Review. The page holds still, and a panel opens beside it.

pin
00:00:34.314 --> 00:00:38.711
Click the part you mean. A numbered pin lands right where you clicked.

rate
00:00:39.512 --> 00:00:47.300
Rate the look under Style and the words under Copy: one is not for me, five is love it. Skip either if you like.

comment
00:00:48.101 --> 00:00:52.591
Then say it in your own words: what you like, or what you would change.

save
00:00:53.392 --> 00:00:58.672
Press Save rating. Your pin stays on the page, and the corner reads All feedback saved.

more
00:00:59.476 --> 00:01:06.520
Do that for as many parts as you like. Page Notes, in the same panel, is for your reaction to the whole page.

change
00:01:07.469 --> 00:01:11.634
Changed your mind? Click a pin, edit it, and save again.

end
00:01:12.436 --> 00:01:21.802
That's all. We build Version 2 from what you tell us, and we email you when it's ready at meissner.services/ann/2.

